{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_adr_0014", "label": "ADR-0014: Scale program \u2014 block/table/zone, GPU shading, per-site origin", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The design range is 1 kW \u2192 100 MW (~150k+ modules) and the POC's single-origin projection, O(n\u00b2) CPU shading and per-panel editing all cliff at scale. Build the no-rewrite foundations now as investment INTO the studio, never as a reason to cut rooftop capability."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_block_table_zone_model", "label": "Block / table (rack) / zone data model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Above rooftop scale the editable unit is the block/table/zone with panels as derived instances; utility incumbents (HelioScope, PVcase, RatedPower) all abstract panels away because 150k independently editable panels is the wrong abstraction."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_gpu_shadow_map_shading", "label": "GPU shadow-map shading (three.js WebGPURenderer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~288 sun-sample depth maps sampled per module in a compute pass; WebGPU is baseline in 2026 with automatic WebGL2 fallback, so staying on WebGLRenderer leaves 2\u201310x on the table for no benefit."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_three_mesh_bvh", "label": "three-mesh-bvh CPU/worker fallback and correctness oracle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept for precise near-field rooftop obstruction raycasts and as the oracle that keeps the GPU path honest; geometry is centred via BufferGeometry.center() to avoid float-precision loss at km scale."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_utm_enu_origin_proj4js", "label": "Per-site UTM/ENU origin via proj4js", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces the single equirectangular origin precisely because of float-precision loss at km scale."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_pure_ts_kernels", "label": "Pure-TS kernels (Web Worker pool + Node worker_threads)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One codebase callable identically from browser and server jobs \u2014 no forked engine."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_single_axis_trackers", "label": "Single-axis trackers + closed-form GCR backtracking", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A TS kernel mirroring pvlib."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_copernicus_glo30_dem", "label": "Copernicus GLO-30 DEM terrain import", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Free, global 30 m with SRTM fallback, meshed ground."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_float_precision_at_km_scale", "label": "Float precision at km scale", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The shared driver behind both geometry centring and the per-site origin change."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_two_layout_paradigms", "label": "Two layout paradigms in one canonical Project model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-panel rooftop and block/table utility layouts must stay coherent; the one-frame gate and fingerprint recompute graph extend to cover both."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_deferred_scope", "label": "Deferred scale scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Terrain-following tracker articulation, server GPU farm, utility-grade electrical autorouting and Rust/WASM kernels are explicitly deferred with reasons in docs/11."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_bvh_only_scaling", "label": "Rejected: scaling per-panel CPU raycast (BVH only)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Removes O(n\u00b2) but still edits/stores/re-shades 150k objects; 150k selectable meshes stall rendering even instanced."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_headless_gl", "label": "Rejected: headless three.js on Node (headless-gl)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fragile and unmaintained for GPU work; same-kernel-on-CPU now, Node WebGPU bindings later."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_rust_wasm_kernel", "label": "Rejected: Rust/WASM shading kernel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Violates the TS-domain rule and forks the engine; only ever justified as a profiled leaf."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_webglrenderer_status_quo", "label": "Rejected: staying on WebGLRenderer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Forgoes compute-shader shading for no benefit given automatic fallback."}, {"id": "docs_11_scale_program_scale_program", "label": "docs/11 \u2014 scale program", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_adr_0014", "target": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_block_table_zone_model", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_adr_0014", "target": "docs_adr_0014_scale_block_model_gpu_shading_gpu_shadow_map_shading", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0014-scale-block-model-gpu-shading.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0},